div data-rid="7f251936-9ed3-4669-a82f-60c8759b220a" class="r-1gr07fw"><div data-rid="d8058ad6-cd76-4711-8511-6d8e30ea064e" class="r-zvu6ke alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I’m Angela founder of Honey Cloudz</p></span></div><div data-rid="73ddef2d-aa20-4ec8-8484-772277a85450" class="r-e7qihv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>After 15 years in swimwear design (and countless frustrating inserts), I knew women deserved better.</p></span></div><div data-rid="1ef36ade-789c-44a6-a15f-fb8d16113e45" class="r-1iwb202 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>So I created a no-slip insert that actually stays in place. It's all about comfort, confidence, and never adjusting mid-day again.</p></span></div></div></div></div><picture data-rid="b340a2af-d6fd-491d-b09e-73fc4504e2c2" class="r-ehek3q"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/cd0ce101-c285-4478-8953-6e99b6e0efe9?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/cd0ce101-c285-4478-8953-6e99b6e0efe9?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/729d0420-6ddf-4dcf-ac96-e003ca3b1ab2?width=1310" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/729d0420-6ddf-4dcf-ac96-e003ca3b1ab2" alt="Smiling woman with dark hair, wearing a floral top, resting her chin on her hand." class="r-j8cd7g" loading="eager"/></picture><picture data-rid="44733d80-5bbb-434a-8d2f-b653c54201f6" class="r-nxm5lx"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/9fc08179-6489-4790-b01d-cfa3763e4e4f?width=328" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/9fc08179-6489-4790-b01d-cfa3763e4e4f?width=328" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/9fc08179-6489-4790-b01d-cfa3763e4e4f?width=328" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/9fc08179-6489-4790-b01d-cfa3763e4e4f" class="r-togyai" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="4fd82172-4333-400d-9ad5-3b2be6c80a3c" class="r-8m9q33"><div data-rid="b262e848-79fc-444d-a951-6a6550f26478" class="r-10rv67f"><div data-rid="778712dc-0cea-4dd0-bb66-39185bc674f8" class="r-1gg7tj4"><div data-rid="9ff3bf2f-bff8-44ef-b927-315207416d25" class="r-fb21fa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Our Story<br></h2></span></div><div data-rid="9d2c9e35-40b3-4b72-bff9-f9c8abbdfd6b" class="r-1dowaz6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>How Honey Cloudz Was Born</h2></span></div></div><div data-rid="e8b37242-8403-44ef-ac22-c2760b48c3ae" class="r-1vp4y1q"><div data-rid="9a63e60e-dc21-4dd9-bfba-12704883d51d" class="r-1q95hpz"><div data-rid="2577ff3d-3ebc-4ee1-9d7f-0e5aaa5399fd" class="r-1ns48ki"><picture data-rid="23a1e73a-f194-43f9-8372-6c2c91410608" class="r-1ys9jid"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/e144a928-aeb5-4fb9-895a-597ae2175c3b?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/e144a928-aeb5-4fb9-895a-597ae2175c3b?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/e144a928-aeb5-4fb9-895a-597ae2175c3b?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/e144a928-aeb5-4fb9-895a-597ae2175c3b" alt="Person sitting on a chair, holding a smartphone, with yarn skeins on the floor." class="r-1xocxn3" loading="laz