data-rid="c42866ec-5a9c-4e9f-8aed-8dde96449dfe" class="r-ey0fia alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2><strong>Repeat.</strong></h2></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="908c71e7-d169-4b94-aac3-854ae5071afe" class="r-qlsd4j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Armed with my <strong>swimwear experience,</strong> I developed and patented the first-ever <strong>hybrid bra insert</strong> with a silicone grippy edge: <strong>no adhesive, no slipping.</strong></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="17b3ac04-998a-4c35-81cf-d6615971a745" class="r-1nfb7za"><picture data-rid="c923d7d2-c0f5-4611-a5fa-db38ab611e9e" class="r-18jfj3l"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/6045f45e-d998-46ce-a020-0a09a97c0d87?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/6045f45e-d998-46ce-a020-0a09a97c0d87?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/6045f45e-d998-46ce-a020-0a09a97c0d87?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/6045f45e-d998-46ce-a020-0a09a97c0d87" alt="Honey Cloudz early bra insert samples and prototypes on a table" class="r-yqn881" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="f477e9e7-fb4c-4425-8d36-525a5c66594e" class="r-162bmc5"><picture data-rid="3431087c-0e0e-4cf3-9a0c-77c7d54d9d3a" class="r-iz4m0r"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/dc591a11-1b40-4167-bde5-7925d1d9d59c?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/dc591a11-1b40-4167-bde5-7925d1d9d59c?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c5